# FatoCheck Architecture Rules

## Project purpose

FatoCheck is a production-oriented NLP and AI engineering project for fake-news classification.

The project contains:

- research notebooks;
- reusable preprocessing and training modules;
- serialized machine-learning artifacts;
- unified inference logic;
- a FastAPI service;
- Docker deployment configuration.

Preserve this separation between research and production code.

## Current architecture

```text
api/
    app.py                 FastAPI transport and HTTP concerns

utils/
    preprocessing.py       Reusable text preprocessing
    training.py            Reusable training logic
    evaluation.py          Reusable evaluation logic
    inference.py           Model loading, routing, and prediction

models/trained/            Serialized trained artifacts

notebooks/                 Research, EDA, and reproducibility

data/                      Raw and processed datasets

Dockerfile                 Production container definition
